/T (What is AI and its Relevance to Travel Marketing AI refers to the simulation of human intelligence processes by machines, particularly computer systems. In the context of travel marketing, AI encompasses a range of technologies and applications, including machine learning, natural language processing \(NLP\), and predictive analytics. AI enables travel brands to analyze vast amounts of data, automate processes, and deliver personalized experiences to customers.)
